  "packageSize": 1238788,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/purelogiccode/RVZSharp",
  "published": "2026-10-11T05:47:54.117Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1: one-shot Zstd chunk compression (level 22 no longer reserves ~128 MiB\n            per parallel worker; output verified byte-identical in Dolphin's dolphin-tool,\n            including a full codec interop matrix) and no empty symbols package (assemblies\n            carry embedded PDBs). Public API stays compatible with 1.0.0.\n            1.1.0: legacy writers (CisoWriter, WbfsWriter, TgcWriter), the DiscVerifier Wii\n            hash-tree/TMD/H3 verifier, thread-safe ReadAt with an LRU cache, the async API,\n            split plain ISO, DiscInfo, BlobStream and scrub options; CLI --json output, -\n            stdin/stdout piping and shell completions; CI with API-compat validation and an\n            embedded SPDX SBOM. Fixes: partition keys are common-key decrypted from the ticket\n            (verify/extract work on real encrypted discs), extract TMD/cert/H3 offsets, WBFS\n            header size/disc-header copy, convert --json stdout hygiene, Ctrl+C exit 130 and\n            monotonic writer progress. Public API stays compatible with 1.0.0.",
